And build in

1077
01:50:14,888 --> 01:50:18,848
a set of terms that would quantify confidence

1078
01:50:19,648 --> 01:50:22,668
and probability of identifications being correct,

1079
01:50:23,848 --> 01:50:27,128
not only for machines, not only for molecular

1080
01:50:27,468 --> 01:50:29,228
pipelines, but also for humans.

1081
01:50:32,348 --> 01:50:34,488
Coordinates, dates, instrument readings,

1082
01:50:35,508 --> 01:50:38,748
they are primary detections. Whereas

1083
01:50:38,808 --> 01:50:42,688
identifications, annotations, trait assignments is interpretive layer,

1084
01:50:42,948 --> 01:50:46,608
which should be versions attributable, revisable by

1085
01:50:46,648 --> 01:50:47,068
design.

